  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nNo basic attack. Deal 24
    contact damage. Can carry nursery bonuses.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTier 1/2/3
    traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN
    THE WAITING REALM\nAn elder from travelling gardens who shelters young plants
    without choosing where they must settle. They move their own roots when home
    becomes unsafe. They seek a garden with more than one open gate.\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies
    and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level
    unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nRecruitment
    exclusive: Jade Cabbage.\r\nBonds: clock, sprout. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
